# init: the progenitor, supervision and the process builder. The role Debian's init and systemd fill.
#
# Milestone 611 (every program and crate belongs to a package). The package's name, kind, home
# and membership are provisional, the lane's proposal for calef to ratify; the format is
# helpers/packages.py's header, and notes/package-boundaries.md has the table and the reasons.

name init
kind base
home init provisional

crate components
crate system_initializer

program progenitor
program root_supervisor
program spawner
program sub_server_supervisor
program job_undertaker
program session_reviver
program broker
program swapper

depends timetable

exception 2026-09-27 system_initializer http_response system_initializer builds the whole interactive image and so links every package's pieces; it is integration, not init
exception 2026-09-27 system_initializer video_terminal the same: integration living in init, and a base package reaching into the optional display package
